                                        "entry_id": "aa600fab-a95a-3a21-9ff2-0b6477f36793",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The cervix uteri, or lower, narrow portion of the uterus where it joins with the top end of the vagina."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "specifically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
